# The sparks' first-time and repeat arms and the cap. 129 (Spoils - Silver Name Tag, repeat, sparks 100). First: triple,
# ROE_FIRST_TIME_SPARKS 300, total 300. Then the repeat: ROE_RECEIVE_SPARKS names 100 and the total is held to the 350
# cap. ROE_REPEAT_OR_CANCEL each time; the record stays on the log at 0.
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=30
setting CAP_CURRENCY_SPARKS 350
login
record take 129
record event LootItem itemid=13116
record event LootItem itemid=13116
